      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Solar activity refers to the dynamic and ever-changing phenomena occurring
    on the Sun\u2019s surface and atmosphere. This includes features like sunspots,
    prominences, coronal loops, and spicules. These activities are driven by the
    Sun\u2019s complex magnetic field, which constantly shifts and interacts. Solar
    activity affects space weather, which can impact satellites, radio communications,
    and even power grids on Earth."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1a6766cc90ee6042bda611a62866980, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 7840408960139126525, guid: c1a6766cc90ee6042bda611a62866980, type: 2}
